    <string name="steps_sources_title">Sources (Health Connect)</string>
    <string name="steps_sources_empty">No app has recorded steps in this phone\'s Health Connect today. Health Connect is a per-phone data store: it doesn\'t sync from another phone through your Google account. Steps appear here once an app (e.g. the health app of your watch, ring or phone) writes them to Health Connect on this device — check the app\'s write permissions and open it once.</string>
    <string name="steps_sources_note">The step count above is Health Connect\'s combined total with overlapping sources removed. Here is each app\'s own count (as calculated by Health Connect) — different rows may measure the same steps, so they shouldn\'t be added together. Watch or ring data only appears once its own app has synced to this phone. You can change the priority of sources in Health Connect settings.</string>
